    "en": {
      "trackName": "Cut Fruit - Watch Game",
      "description": "Cut Fruit is a quick action game designed for Apple Watch.\n\nFruit flies up from the bottom of the screen. Swipe to slice it, avoid bombs, and try not to miss too many fruits. The rules are simple, the pace is fast, and each round is perfect for a short break.\n\nFeatures:\n- Optimized for Apple Watch\n- Arcade, Zen, and Hardcore modes\n- Juicy slicing effects and quick feedback\n- Bombs, missed fruits, combos, and high score chasing\n- Free trials, with unlimited play in the full version\n- No network required\n\nRaise your wrist, slice the flying fruit, and chase your best score.",
